a\",\"name\":\"P5 · Behavioral Intelligence (North Star)\",\"summary\":\"The payoff: turn retained behavior into decisions. Prompt-quality per person, a best-prompt library, agent/person-to-task fit, and auto-routing.\",\"description\":\"**The north star of the Semantic Reasoning Layer: turn retained behavior into decisions.** Every session, prompt, and outcome is already captured as checkpoints. This layer mines it.\\n\\n## Outcome\\n\\n* **Prompt intelligence**: score prompt quality before a run, see which people write prompts that succeed, and surface a best-prompt library of exemplars mined from real checkpoints.\\n* **Fit modeling**: who (or which model/agent) succeeds on what kind… (truncated, use `get_project` for full description)\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/project/p5-behavioral-intelligence-north-star-1bb9991bc853\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-10T00:41:30.265Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-10T01:39:59.163Z\",\"startedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"startDate\":\"2027-01-01\",\"startDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"targetDate\":\"2027-06-30\",\"targetDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"labels\":[],\"initiatives\":[{\"id\":\"c1fba6dc-5025-43bd-9e9e-08792e1f7386\",\"name\":\"Semantic Reasoning Layer\"}],\"lead\":{\"id\":\"383d093a-5c76-4a6c-9c2b-660b61ca3f3d\",\"name\":\"Suhaan Thayyil\"},\"leadTeam\":{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"},\"status\":{\"id\":\"db01ebd4-e958-4a01-ba30-c15a9727eaa1\",\"name\":\"Planned\",\"type\":\"planned\"},\"teams\":[{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"}]},{\"id\"…1560 tokens truncated…*Make the memory shared across teams and fleets, not just within a repo.** Git-native discovery stops at the repo boundary — an agent can't find who reasoned about similar code elsewhere, and there's no registry to route a task to the right agent.\\n\\n## Outcome\\n\\nShared reasoning across repos/orgs: an agent in one repo surfaces relevant prior reasoning from another; tasks route to the right agent by capability.\\n\\n## Key work\\n\\n* Cross-repo semanti… (truncated, use `get_project` for full description)\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/project/cross-repo-shared-reasoning-0f9532a0d661\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-01T02:24:40.236Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-09T01:22:31.423Z\",\"startedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"startDate\":\"2027-01-01\",\"startDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"targetDate\":\"2027-03-31\",\"targetDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"priority\":{\"value\":3,\"name\":\"Medium\"},\"labels\":[],\"initiatives\":[{\"id\":\"c1fba6dc-5025-43bd-9e9e-08792e1f7386\",\"name\":\"Semantic Reasoning Layer\"}],\"lead\":{},\"leadTeam\":{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"},\"status\":{\"id\":\"db01ebd4-e958-4a01-ba30-c15a9727eaa1\",\"name\":\"Planned\",\"type\":\"planned\"},\"teams\":[{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"}]},{\"id\":\"530f509f-5b50-4217-b020-84047646fe68\",\"uuid\":\"530f509f-5b50-4217-b020-84047646fe68\",\"icon\":\":handshake:\",\"color\":\"#eb5757\",\"name\":\"Semantic Collision-Free Parallel Agents\",\"summary\":\"Let fleets of agents build in parallel without colliding: entity-level claims, pre-merge semantic conflict detection, structured handovers, and a scheduler over ready tasks.\",\"description\":\"**Fleets that build in parallel \\\"without overwriting, colliding, or losing understanding.\\\"** Today agents can't coordinate: no entity-level ownership, no pre-merge semantic conflict detection, no structured handovers, no scheduler. Two agents editing the same function silently collide.\\n\\n## Outcome\\n\\nAgents claim work at the **entity level** (a function/type, not the whole file) using the P0 semantic index; overlapping edits are detected **befor… (truncated, use `get_project` for full description)\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/project/semantic-collision-free-parallel-agents-e20ca0e40e08\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-01T02:24:32.624Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-09T01:21:53.401Z\",\"startedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-10-01\",\"startDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"targetDate\":\"2027-03-31\",\"targetDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"labels\":[],\"initiatives\":[{\"id\":\"c1fba6dc-5025-43bd-9e9e-08792e1f7386\",\"name\":\"Semantic Reasoning Layer\"}],\"lead\":{},\"leadTeam\":{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"},\"status\":{\"id\":\"db01ebd4-e958-4a01-ba30-c15a9727eaa1\",\"name\":\"Planned\",\"type\":\"planned\"},\"teams\":[{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"}]},{\"id\":\"b50cc74a-cecb-4e5a-8bd4-1c0fb383d3cb\",\"uuid\":\"b50cc74a-cecb-4e5a-8bd4-1c0fb383d3cb\",\"icon\":\":thought_balloon:\",\"color\":\"#f2994a\",\"name\":\"Reasoning Capture & Compounding Memory\",\"summary\":\"Capture agent reasoning (not just transcripts) as structured, queryable facts that compound across runs — so understanding is preserved, not restarted.\",\"description\":\"**Preserve meaning, and make it compound.** Agents capture transcripts, not reasoning. Reasoning surfaces (review, scheduled synthesis, chat assistants) emit prose that gets overwritten; agents *consume* memory but don't *write reasoned facts back* — so understanding restarts every run.\\n\\n## Outcome\\n\\nA structured reasoning record per checkpoint/trail (entities changed, decisions, constraints, risks, blast radius — machine-readable, not LLM pros… (truncated, use `get_project` for full description)\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/project/reasoning-capture-and-compounding-memory-db95c0b2ef1c\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-01T02:24:29.461Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-09T01:21:49.988Z\",\"startedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-10-01\",\"startDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-12-31\",\"targetDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"labels\":[],\"initiatives\":[{\"id\":\"c1fba6dc-5025-43bd-9e9e-08792e1f7386\",\"name\":\"Semantic Reasoning Layer\"}],\"lead\":{},\"leadTeam\":{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"},\"status\":{\"id\":\"db01ebd4-e958-4a01-ba30-c15a9727eaa1\",\"name\":\"Planned\",\"type\":\"planned\"},\"teams\":[{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"}]},{\"id\":\"1628fe9f-461e-4d8e-937c-def8a3628ca8\",\"uuid\":\"1628fe9f-461e-4d8e-937c-def8a3628ca8\",\"icon\":\":books:\",\"color\":\"#4cb782\",\"name\":\"Unified, Pluggable Agent Memory\",\"summary\":\"Converge the fragmented retrieval + knowledge systems into one shared memory on one backbone, exposed through MCP so every agent queries the same thing.\",\"description\":\"**Make memory \\\"shared and pluggable.\\\"** Today memory + retrieval are fragmented: several parallel code-search efforts and two parallel knowledge systems. No single shared, pluggable memory surface exists — which the vision explicitly requires.\\n\\n## Outcome\\n\\nOne shared memory (semantic index + code retrieval + knowledge) on **one** embedding backbone, exposed through **MCP** so every agent (Claude Code / Codex / Droid / Cursor / Gemini / …) quer… (truncated, use `get_project` for full description)\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/project/unified-pluggable-agent-memory-eaf5762e7339\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-01T02:24:20.683Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-10T01:39:52.799Z\",\"startedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-07-01\",\"startDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-12-31\",\"targetDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"priority\":{\"value\":2,\"name\":\"High\"},\"labels\":[],\"initiatives\":[{\"id\":\"c1fba6dc-5025-43bd-9e9e-08792e1f7386\",\"name\":\"Semantic Reasoning Layer\"}],\"lead\":{},\"leadTeam\":{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"},\"status\":{\"id\":\"db01ebd4-e958-4a01-ba30-c15a9727eaa1\",\"name\":\"Planned\",\"type\":\"planned\"},\"teams\":[{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"}]},{\"id\":\"9322a362-b261-425f-827d-7bba84620fcb\",\"uuid\":\"9322a362-b261-425f-827d-7bba84620fcb\",\"icon\":\":brain:\",\"color\":\"#5e6ad2\",\"name\":\"Semantic Index Tied to VCS History\",\"summary\":\"Keystone: persist entity-level meaning (from the semantic extractor) onto checkpoints + a git-native index, so meaning is stored with version-control history, not re-parsed on demand.\",\"description\":\"**The keystone of the initiative.** \\\"Version control preserves change, not meaning.\\\" We have an accurate semantic extractor (entity + call-graph, compiler-benchmarked in `brain-bench`), but its output is not persisted with checkpoints — so meaning is re-parsed on demand and can't be queried over history.\\n\\n## Outcome\\n\\nEvery checkpoint records *which semantic entities changed* (e.g. `auth.UserValidator` + its callers), and a git-native index ans… (truncated, use `get_project` for full description)\",\"url\":\"https://linear.app/entirehq/project/semantic-index-tied-to-vcs-history-ea453fa387e2\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-07-01T02:24:18.417Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-07-09T01:21:46.040Z\",\"startedAt\":null,\"completedAt\":null,\"canceledAt\":null,\"startDate\":\"2026-07-01\",\"startDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"targetDate\":\"2026-09-30\",\"targetDateResolution\":\"quarter\",\"priority\":{\"value\":1,\"name\":\"Urgent\"},\"labels\":[],\"initiatives\":[{\"id\":\"c1fba6dc-5025-43bd-9e9e-08792e1f7386\",\"name\":\"Semantic Reasoning Layer\"}],\"lead\":{},\"leadTeam\":{\"id\":\"894690b6-2173-4cbe-abd3-6e7ea5ff5bb9\",\"name\":\"Core\",\"key\":\"COR\"},\"status\":{\"id\":\"db01ebd4-e958-4a01-ba30-c15a9727eaa1\",\"name\":\"Planned\",\"type\":